From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Muthukumar <mk@verveflux.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Feb 2026 11:58:19 +0530
Subject: Refactor navigator overrides to UAOverrideManager, fix SubtleCrypto
 and EventTarget

Navigator overrides (UA, platform, language, hardwareConcurrency, deviceMemory,
onLine) migrated from per-call JS override lookups via GetCustomOverrideFunction
+ V8ScriptRunner::CallFunction to pre-stored values in UAOverrideManager. This
eliminates V8 round-trips on every property access and enables consistent
overrides across workers and shared workers.

Changes per file:

  navigator_ua_data.idl/h/cc:
  - Extended UAOverrideValues dictionary and UAOverrideValues_Storage with
    navigator-level fields: userAgent, navigatorPlatform, language, languages,
    onLine, hardwareConcurrency, deviceMemory
  - Added SetFallbackStorage() for shared workers with different cluster IDs
  - GetStorageForCluster() now falls back to process-wide default when no
    cluster-specific override exists or cluster ID is empty
  - Replaced thread_local brand cache with member field cached_override_brands_
  - Simplified brandsForBinding/platformForBinding to delegate to non-binding
    methods (which already read from UAOverrideManager)

  navigator_base.cc:
  - Removed V8ScriptRunner-based userAgent override, now returns raw UA
    (override applied via UAOverrideManager in NavigatorID::userAgentForBinding)
  - onLineForBinding reads from UAOverrideManager storage

  navigator_id.cc:
  - appVersionForBinding, platformForBinding, userAgentForBinding now read
    from UAOverrideManager instead of calling JS override functions
  - Removed local MaybeStringOverride helper

  navigator_language.cc:
  - languageForBinding, languagesForBinding read from UAOverrideManager
  - Removed local MaybeStringOverride helper and V8ScriptRunner includes

  navigator_concurrent_hardware.cc:
  - hardwareConcurrencyForBinding reads from UAOverrideManager
  - Removed local MaybeUnsignedOverride helper

  navigator_device_memory.cc:
  - deviceMemoryForBinding reads from UAOverrideManager
  - Removed local MaybeFloatOverride helper

  event_target.cc:
  - Guard addEventListener override check with !ScriptForbiddenScope to prevent
    crash during SVG shadow tree cloning where scripts are forbidden
  - Add v8::MicrotasksScope::kDoNotRunMicrotasks to prevent V8 fatal error
    when called from HTML parser (SetAttributeEventListener path) with no
    V8 frames on the stack

  subtle_crypto.cc:
  - Replaced MaybeSubtleCryptoOverride (which called override with 0 args and
    replaced the entire crypto operation with the override's return value) with
    MaybeChainSubtleCryptoOverride (which chains override as .then() handler
    on the real crypto promise, so the override receives the actual resolved
    value and can inspect/modify it)
  - Removed early-return override checks from all 12 SubtleCrypto methods
  - Each method now runs the real crypto operation first, then chains the
    override via v8::Promise::Then() before returning

